meta {
  name: nhpr
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  M4, the NHPR (ADR-015). Facility side: look a registry facility up, search, link it to this Care
  facility, run the HFR onboarding wizard (needs the manager's HPR login), verify a programme link by
  OTP. User side: the caller's own HPR ID (login, HPID creation, register professional, documents).
  Masters: the registry code lists, cached 24 h. Set `facilityId`; the user routes act on the caller.
}
